  "concept": "Static workflow-kit files and workflow helper scripts are copied as-is. Project files are rendered or generated from .opencode/project.json by /init-project after the Greenfield Gate confirms an empty/docs-only product repo. This kit is not an adoption/migration workflow for existing product code, tests, dependency manifests, or CI. Text file hashes normalize CRLF/CR to LF before sha256 so validation is stable across operating systems."
